{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29117","headline":"余谢病东归王秀才见寄今潘秀才南櫂奉酬 · 许浑","name":"余谢病东归王秀才见寄今潘秀才南櫂奉酬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酷似牢之玉不如，落星山下白云居。\n春耕旋构金门客，夜学兼修玉府书。\n风扫碧云迎鸷鸟，水还沧海养嘉鱼。\n莫将年少轻时节，王氏家风在石渠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}